   - Happens: role changes pause; media may continue briefly with last-known leases.  
-  - Detect: shard health, missed heartbeats, stalled epoch updates.  
-  - Recover: leader election within the shard group, reload room snapshot from event log, resume epoch issuance; leases expire quickly to prevent “immortal speakers”.
